OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run killer Gary Anderson
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn on-the-run killer who absconded
OL,7,Fafter being permitted to attend his
OL,8,Ffather's funeral in Northern Ireland 10
OL,9,Fdays ago has appeared in court in the
OL,10,FRepublic of Ireland, where he was
OL,11,Farrested on Wednesday.
OL,13,FGary Anderson, 29, appeared at a
OL,14,Fspecial sitting of Letterkenny District
OL,15,FCourt on Thursday following his arrest
OL,16,Fat a campsite near Buncrana, by An
OL,17,FGarda Siochana (Irish police).
OL,19,FHe had been serving life in prison for
OL,20,Fthe murder of Karol Kelly in
OL,21,FLondonderry in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
