OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run killer Gary Anderson
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court was told Anderson is charged
OL,7,Fwith being present at Fahan Marina
OL,8,Fcaravan and campsite on 23 September,
OL,9,Fhaving escaped from Maghaberry Prison,
OL,10,Fcontrary to Section 3(1) of the
OL,11,FCriminal Law (Jurisdiction) Act 1976.
